    "current310_log_line_1609": "resting_common_domain_rejection=pass status=5 accepted_physical_and_circulation_unchanged=true controller_history_and_common_presentation_unchanged=true retry_predecessor_generation=1",
    "current310_log_line_1610": "resting_integrated_rejection=pass rejected_after_accepted_predecessor=true body_q_v_root_myo_unchanged=true circulation_and_clock_unchanged=true respiration_brain_history_unchanged=true retry_matches_uninterrupted_replay=true same_command_buffer_reject=pass accepted_prefix=2 rejected_step=2 inert_suffix=1 multistep_reject=pass accepted_prefix=4 rejected_global_step=4 inert_suffix_global_step=5 raw_failed_submission_snapshot=pass all_owners_match_uninterrupted_prefix=true accepted_contact_history=disabled retry=fresh_context_reseed_and_replay_matches_six_root_baseline same_context_retry=unsupported",
    "fresh_context_replay": "The fresh-context six-root replay compares physical arrays, broad continuation-authoritative Matter state, accepted respiration/Brain buffers, presentation buffers/cursor, and contact warm-start only when enabled. Both current310 and 1217 report accepted_contact_history=disabled, so warm-start history itself was not tested.",
    "multistep_case": "After an accepted two-root prefix, a four-root submission injects rejection at global step4 and confirms the failed submission retained the accepted four-root physical/Matter/coupling prefix; the callback also verifies inert step5. The failed multi-root context is treated as terminal; retry uses a new context, reseeds the two-root prefix, replays four more roots, and compares against uninterrupted six-root state.",
    "rejected_single_step": "The probe first accepts one root, sets respiration.dispatch.reject=1, and submits the second resident continuation. It compares root/q/v/muscle arrays bytewise; vascular state+clock bytes plus controlStep/physicsSubstep; respiration.accepted; brain.accepted; presentation body/respiration/common-coordinate/frame buffers; common-state initialization and presentedStep. It requires a respiratory candidate rejection status and Matter failure status.",
    "same_context_retry": "After clearing the injected reject flag, the single-step case calls run again on the same trialContext with the rejected continuation input and requires the resulting two-root state to match the uninterrupted two-root baseline. This bounded same-context retry passes."
  },
